# Proof: F-V3-CAPTURE
# Top: v3_capture
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset; arbitrary sampling, timestamp and control inputs.
# Properties: Count bound, truncation, reason 6 never reported, invalid read masking, and stopped-state stability.
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal src/v3_capture.v
prep -top v3_capture
flatten
memory_map
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 4 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -verify
